   ["상담 글: I study hard, but my grades don't go up. What should I do? / 원문 답장: You must study harder.(강한 명령, 상처)", "고침: I understand how you feel. You should check which types of questions you get wrong. Maybe you could try studying with a friend. / 어감: must(의무) > had better(경고) > should(조언) > could(제안, 선택)"],
